{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16550","headline":"龙池春草 · 陈翊","name":"龙池春草","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青春光凤苑，细草徧龙池。\n曲渚交苹叶，回塘惹柳枝。\n因风初苒苒，覆岸欲离离。\n色带金堤静，阴连玉树移。\n日光浮靃靡，波影动参差。\n岂比生幽远，芳馨衆不知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈翊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16550.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16550","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}